{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/421282-the-plot-hooks-the-dark-eras-archive","id":421282,"title":"The Plot Hooks: The Dark Eras Archive","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-26T22:11:26-08:00","id":421282,"title":"The Plot Hooks: The Dark Eras Archive","content":"We have three Dark Eras.<br /> <br /> Three.<br /> <br /> That and several eras from other lines that can be easily converted or harvested for ideas or one-shot adventures.<br /> <br /> Let's bask in that glow for a while. Once we're done basking, let's start filling those era with stories.<br /> <br /> <br /> 1. Broken Arrow (Berlin): Unchained in the present era know that the world did not end in the horror of nuclear war. Demon's living in the Cold War are denied that delusion. Berlin has burned four times in nuclear war, the G-M just splits the timeline, pruning the world-that-ends from the world the world-that-remains. The split time is then deleted after four days. What the G-M does in that time is anyone's guess. The problem is an unlucky Demon can find themselves trapped in the reality marked for deletion. A few survivors tell wild tales of having to escape from wastelands that collapse all around them. And it's always only a single survivor or two, never an entire ring, leading one to quite naturally question what you have to give up to escape...<br /> <br /> 2. Poker Night (Russian Revolution): Poker with Demons is always a hoot. The only rule is that you can cheat if you don't get caught. The stakes are never money; any Demon worth of the name can assemble a small fortune in a day or less. The stakes are... something unique, oddities: a patch pact, a rare naturally occurring gadget, cryptoflora samples, information on G-M projects. Even if you lose the game, bringing interesting or useful stake wins respect from the rest of the table. One day, an Unchained sits down at the table and puts down his stake: a soul pact with the signature of one Grigori Yefimovich <i>Rasputin</i>. &quot;Yes it's real, and it's brought me no end of misery, it's all yours.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 08-16-2020, 12:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T02:26:44-08:00","id":421510,"title":"","content":"Cracking start. Will have to get my thinking cap on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The phrase 'flies on the heads of pins' appeared 43 times in that journal, sometimes in the middle of sentences or written in the margins.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4871-malkydel","name":"Malkydel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4871_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-02T00:57:49-08:00","id":424961,"title":"","content":"&quot;Opiate of the Masses. <br /> <br /> No one can quite remember where the printing press came from, but it tells only the truth. Any lie printed with it seems like the most palatable truth, and that belief is a powerful weapon in these uncertain times.<br /> <br /> Even as the rebels and revolutionaries who control it, a cult in all but name, use it for their own ends, it is the Angels who shape the minds of city and nation by night. <br /> <br /> Some would see it destroyed. Others wonder, what form of Hell might it help to hew out of an evolving Russia?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The phrase 'flies on the heads of pins' appeared 43 times in that journal, sometimes in the middle of sentences or written in the margins.&quot;","edited":{"userid":4871,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4871-malkydel","user":"Malkydel","date":". 03-02-2015, 06:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4871-malkydel","name":"Malkydel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4871_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T18:25:05-07:00","id":1400438,"title":"","content":"I recalled a certain <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=26EivpCPHnQ\" target=\"_blank\">video by Oversimplified</a>, and was Inspired.<br /> <br /> 4. One Kingdom, two Kingdoms, three Kingdoms, four- wait <i><b>WHAT?!?!</b></i><br /> <br /> Dong Zhuo has just been assassinated and civil war has broken out across all of China. Thanks to the sheer complexity of the web of alliances, betrayals, warfare, intrigue, duels, assassinations, riots, rebellions and so on, the God-Machine has found it extremely difficult to maintain its current holdings, let alone develop new ones!<br /> <br /> This, of course, means it\u2019s a near <i>perfect</i> time for Demons to rise up, take control and become their own Warlords (or at least the advisor of one or more of them). But it\u2019s just as dangerous for the Unchained, for they have to be wary in extremis for betrayal from far more angles than the typical warlord.<br /> <br /> Will you rise up to try and claim the Emperor\u2019s throne, or be the shadowy puppeteer, making those in the limelight dance to your tune?<br /> Will you seek to unite your fellows against the Cosmic Mill, or tear them down for ever more power?<br /> What sort of Hell will you forge from the ashes and mud of war?<br /> <br /> For You are Unchained, and You Will. Not. Serve.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 07-03-2020, 12:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}